# Gibberish: Broken Trace on CH5 between U14 pin 15 (O5) and U15 pin 22 (A9); A9 floats high, so
# every letter (codes 0x01-0x1A) is read as 0x21-0x3A: punctuation and digits. Spaces are unchanged.
machine message
title "Gibberish"
brief "The poem has turned into digits and punctuation marks, though the words keep their lengths and places."
fault crack U14.O5 U15.A9 50%
